l GDP than the initial equilibrium.\",\"uncertain\":false}],\"summary\":\"A clear, relevant AD-AS diagram is present. It shows aggregate demand shifting left from AD1 to AD2 against SRAS, moving equilibrium from E1 to E2, with both price level falling (PL1 to PL2) and real output falling (Y1 to Y2).\"}"
